(function(){var T=window.TRANSLATIONS;if(!T)return;var d={"tr":{"blog_p97_mezzanine_title":"Mezanin Kat ve Çelik Platform İmalatı: Statik, EN 1090, Korkuluk ve Montaj | ArmaWeld","blog_p97_mezzanine_meta_desc":"Fabrika ve depolarda mezanin kat, bakım platformu ve makine platformu imalatı: statik hesap ve yük sınıfı, EN 1090 CE işareti, ızgara ve döşeme seçimi, EN ISO 14122 merdiven ve korkuluk, galvaniz ve cıvatalı montaj.","blog_p97_mezzanine_og_title":"Mezanin kat ve çelik platform imalatı","blog_p97_mezzanine_tag":"Ürün Rehberi · Çelik Yapı","blog_p97_mezzanine_h1":"Mezanin Kat ve Çelik Platform İmalatı: Statik, EN 1090, Korkuluk ve Montaj","blog_p97_mezzanine_breadcrumb3":"Mezanin ve platform","blog_p97_mezzanine_read":"7 dk okuma","blog_p97_mezzanine_body":"<p>Depoda ek stok alanı, bir makinenin üstüne bakım yürüyüş yolu ya da üretim hattının üzerinde ofis… Mezanin katlar ve çelik platformlar, binayı büyütmeden kullanılabilir alan kazanmanın en hızlı yoludur. Satın alma tarafında genellikle \"standart bir platform\" gibi görülse de taşıyıcı bir yapı oldukları için hesap, belge ve montaj disiplini ister.</p>\n<h2>Önce Yük, Sonra Profil</h2>\n<p>Platformun kullanım amacı yükü belirler: yaya trafiği, palet istifi, raf sistemi, forklift veya transpalet, makine ağırlığı. Bu yükler, kolon açıklıkları ve zemin (mevcut beton döşemenin taşıma kapasitesi, ankraj imkânı) birlikte statik hesapla değerlendirilir. Hesabı yapan mühendis profil kesitlerini, birleşimleri ve kaynak dikişlerini tanımlar (bkz. <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">kaynak dikişi mukavemet hesabı</a>). İmalatçı bu hesaba göre hazırlanmış imalat resimleriyle çalışır.</p>\n<h2>EN 1090 ve CE İşareti</h2>\n<p>Avrupa'da kalıcı olarak yapıya monte edilen taşıyıcı çelik bileşenler EN 1090-1 kapsamında CE işareti ile piyasaya sürülür; mezaninler ve kalıcı platformlar genellikle EXC2 sınıfında ele alınır (bkz. <a href=\"en-1090-exc2-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC2 nedir</a>). Yurt içi projelerde de aynı disiplin, kaynak prosedürleri, nitelikli kaynakçı ve malzeme izlenebilirliği açısından iyi bir referanstır.</p>\n<h2>Döşeme Seçimi</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Izgara (grating):</strong> Hafif, ışık ve hava geçirir, sprinkler sistemiyle uyumlu; küçük parça düşmesine karşı ince gözlü tip seçilebilir.</li>\n<li><strong>Baklava desenli sac:</strong> Kapalı yüzey; ağırlığı ve kaynak çarpılmasını hesaba katın.</li>\n<li><strong>Trapez sac üzeri beton veya ahşap esaslı panel:</strong> Ağır raf ve transpalet trafiği için yaygın.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Merdiven, Korkuluk ve Erişim</h2>\n<p>Makine ve tesislere kalıcı erişim yolları için EN ISO 14122 serisi; merdiven eğimi, basamak ölçüleri, korkuluk yüksekliği, ara küpeşte ve süpürgelik gibi detayları tanımlar. Yük alma alanlarında palet kapısı veya bariyer kapısı planlanmalıdır. Bu detaylar sonradan eklendiğinde genellikle sahada kaynak ve boya hasarı demektir.</p>\n<h2>Kaynaklı Mı, Cıvatalı Mı?</h2>\n<p>Mezaninlerde atölyede kaynaklanan kirişler, kolon ayakları ve bağlantı levhaları sahada cıvatayla birleştirilir (bkz. <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">kaynaklı mı cıvatalı mı</a>). Bu yaklaşım sahada kaynağı azaltır, galvaniz veya boyayı korur ve montajı hızlandırır. Parça boyutları kamyon ve kapı ölçülerine göre bölünmelidir.</p>\n<h2>Yüzey Koruma</h2>\n<p>Kuru iç ortamda boya genellikle yeterlidir; nemli depolar, gıda alanları veya dış ortam için sıcak daldırma galvaniz düşünülür (bkz. <a href=\"sicak-daldirma-galvaniz-kaynakli-parca.html\">galvaniz için kaynaklı parça</a>). Galvaniz seçildiğinde havalandırma ve drenaj delikleri imalat resminde olmalıdır.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>ArmaWeld'de:</strong> Mezanin ve platform kirişlerini, kolonları, merdiven ve korkuluk elemanlarını mühendis onaylı imalat resimlerine göre kaynaklıyoruz. Kesim, delik delme, galvaniz veya boya ile sahada montajı iş ortaklarımızla koordine ediyoruz. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Çelik konstrüksiyon →</a></p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_faq":"<h2>Sık Sorulan Sorular</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Mezanin için statik hesap gerekir mi?</h3><p>Evet; kullanım yükü, açıklıklar ve zemin kapasitesi mühendis tarafından hesaplanmalıdır.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Mezaninde EN 1090 gerekir mi?</h3><p>Avrupa'da kalıcı taşıyıcı bileşenler EN 1090-1 ile CE işaretlenir; genellikle EXC2 uygulanır.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Merdiven ve korkuluk için hangi standart?</h3><p>Kalıcı erişim yolları için EN ISO 14122 serisi.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Montaj kaynaklı mı yapılır?</h3><p>Genellikle atölyede kaynaklanan parçalar sahada cıvatayla birleştirilir.</p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_h3":"Mezanin veya platform projeniz mi var?","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_p":"Statik hesap ve imalat resimlerini gönderin; imalat teklifimizi hazırlayalım.","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_btn":"Teklif İste →","blog_related_h":"İlgili Makaleler","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Çelik Konstrüksiyon İmalat: Tasarımdan Montaja","blog_p02_exc2_h1":"EN 1090-2 EXC2 Nedir? EXC2 ile EXC3 Arasındaki Pratik Farklar","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Kaynaklı mı Cıvatalı mı? Birleştirme Yöntemi Seçimi İçin Mühendislik Rehberi","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Sıcak Daldırma Galvaniz Yapılacak Kaynaklı Parça Nasıl Tasarlanır? Delikler, Kaynak ve Çelik Seçimi"},"en":{"blog_p97_mezzanine_title":"Mezzanine Floor and Steel Platform Fabrication: Structure, EN 1090, Guardrails and Erection | ArmaWeld","blog_p97_mezzanine_meta_desc":"Fabricating mezzanine floors, maintenance and machine platforms: structural calculation and loads, EN 1090 CE marking, grating and decking choice, EN ISO 14122 stairs and guardrails, galvanising and bolted erection.","blog_p97_mezzanine_og_title":"Mezzanine and steel platform fabrication","blog_p97_mezzanine_tag":"Product Guide · Steel Structures","blog_p97_mezzanine_h1":"Mezzanine Floor and Steel Platform Fabrication: Structure, EN 1090, Guardrails and Erection","blog_p97_mezzanine_breadcrumb3":"Mezzanines and platforms","blog_p97_mezzanine_read":"7 min read","blog_p97_mezzanine_body":"<p>Extra storage in a warehouse, a maintenance walkway above a machine or an office above a production line: mezzanines and steel platforms are the fastest way to gain usable space without enlarging the building. Purchasing often treats them as a \"standard platform\", but they are load-bearing structures and need discipline in calculation, documentation and erection.</p>\n<h2>Load First, Then Sections</h2>\n<p>The use defines the load: foot traffic, pallet storage, racking, forklifts or pallet trucks, machine weight. These loads, column spacing and the floor (capacity of the existing slab, anchoring options) are assessed together in a structural calculation. The engineer defines sections, connections and welds (see <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">weld strength calculation</a>). The fabricator works from shop drawings based on that calculation.</p>\n<h2>EN 1090 and CE Marking</h2>\n<p>In Europe, load-bearing steel components permanently installed in buildings are placed on the market with CE marking under EN 1090-1; mezzanines and permanent platforms are usually handled as EXC2 (see <a href=\"en-1090-exc2-nedir.html\">what is EN 1090 EXC2</a>). Outside the EU the same discipline is a good reference for welding procedures, qualified welders and material traceability.</p>\n<h2>Decking Choice</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Grating:</strong> light, lets light and air through, compatible with sprinklers; fine-mesh types stop small parts falling.</li>\n<li><strong>Chequer plate:</strong> closed surface; allow for weight and welding distortion.</li>\n<li><strong>Concrete on profiled sheet or wood-based panels:</strong> common for heavy racking and pallet truck traffic.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Stairs, Guardrails and Access</h2>\n<p>The EN ISO 14122 series covers permanent means of access to machinery and plant: stair pitch, step dimensions, guardrail height, knee rail and toe board. Loading areas need a pallet gate or barrier gate. Adding these later usually means site welding and coating damage.</p>\n<h2>Welded or Bolted?</h2>\n<p>Beams, column bases and connection plates are shop welded and bolted on site (see <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">welded or bolted</a>). This reduces site welding, protects the coating and speeds erection. Split parts to fit truck and door dimensions.</p>\n<h2>Surface Protection</h2>\n<p>Paint is usually enough in dry interiors; humid warehouses, food areas or outdoors call for hot-dip galvanising (see <a href=\"sicak-daldirma-galvaniz-kaynakli-parca.html\">welded parts for galvanising</a>). If galvanised, vent and drain holes belong on the shop drawing.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>At ArmaWeld:</strong> we weld mezzanine and platform beams, columns, stair and guardrail parts to engineer-approved shop drawings. Cutting, drilling, galvanising or painting and site erection are coordinated with our partners. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Steel construction →</a></p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_faq":"<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Does a mezzanine need a structural calculation?</h3><p>Yes; use loads, spans and floor capacity must be calculated by an engineer.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Is EN 1090 required?</h3><p>In Europe permanent load-bearing components are CE marked under EN 1090-1, usually EXC2.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Which standard for stairs and guardrails?</h3><p>The EN ISO 14122 series for permanent means of access.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Is erection welded?</h3><p>Usually shop-welded parts are bolted together on site.</p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_h3":"Planning a mezzanine or platform?","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_p":"Send the structural calculation and shop drawings; we will quote fabrication.","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_btn":"Request a Quote →","blog_related_h":"Related Articles","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Steel Structure Manufacturing: From Design to Erection","blog_p02_exc2_h1":"What Is EN 1090-2 EXC2? Practical Differences Between EXC2 and EXC3","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Welded or Bolted? An Engineering Guide to Choosing the Connection","blog_n29_galv_h1":"How to Design Welded Parts for Hot-Dip Galvanizing: Holes, Welding and Steel Selection"},"de":{"blog_p97_mezzanine_title":"Stahlbühnen und Podeste fertigen: Statik, EN 1090, Geländer und Montage | ArmaWeld","blog_p97_mezzanine_meta_desc":"Fertigung von Stahlbühnen, Wartungs- und Maschinenpodesten: Statik und Lastannahmen, CE-Kennzeichnung nach EN 1090, Gitterrost oder Belag, Treppen und Geländer nach EN ISO 14122, Verzinkung und geschraubte Montage.","blog_p97_mezzanine_og_title":"Stahlbühnen und Podeste fertigen","blog_p97_mezzanine_tag":"Produktleitfaden · Stahlbau","blog_p97_mezzanine_h1":"Stahlbühnen und Podeste fertigen: Statik, EN 1090, Geländer und Montage","blog_p97_mezzanine_breadcrumb3":"Stahlbühnen","blog_p97_mezzanine_read":"7 Min. Lesezeit","blog_p97_mezzanine_body":"<p>Zusätzliche Lagerfläche, ein Wartungssteg über einer Maschine oder ein Büro über der Linie: Stahlbühnen sind der schnellste Weg zu mehr Nutzfläche ohne Anbau. Im Einkauf gelten sie oft als „Standardbühne\", doch sie sind tragende Bauwerke und verlangen Disziplin bei Statik, Dokumentation und Montage.</p>\n<h2>Erst die Last, dann das Profil</h2>\n<p>Die Nutzung bestimmt die Last: Begehung, Palettenlager, Regale, Stapler oder Hubwagen, Maschinengewicht. Lasten, Stützenraster und Untergrund (Tragfähigkeit der Bodenplatte, Verankerung) werden in der Statik zusammen bewertet. Der Tragwerksplaner legt Profile, Anschlüsse und Nähte fest (siehe <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">Schweißnahtberechnung</a>). Der Fertiger arbeitet nach darauf basierenden Werkstattzeichnungen.</p>\n<h2>EN 1090 und CE-Kennzeichnung</h2>\n<p>In Europa werden dauerhaft eingebaute tragende Stahlbauteile nach EN 1090-1 mit CE-Kennzeichnung in Verkehr gebracht; Bühnen und feste Podeste meist in EXC2 (siehe <a href=\"en-1090-exc2-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC2</a>). Auch außerhalb der EU ist diese Disziplin ein guter Maßstab für Schweißverfahren, geprüfte Schweißer und Rückverfolgbarkeit.</p>\n<h2>Belag</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gitterrost:</strong> leicht, licht- und luftdurchlässig, sprinklerverträglich; engmaschig gegen herabfallende Kleinteile.</li>\n<li><strong>Tränenblech:</strong> geschlossen; Gewicht und Schweißverzug beachten.</li>\n<li><strong>Beton auf Trapezblech oder Holzwerkstoffplatten:</strong> üblich bei schweren Regalen und Hubwagenverkehr.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Treppen, Geländer, Zugang</h2>\n<p>Die Reihe EN ISO 14122 regelt ortsfeste Zugänge zu Maschinen und Anlagen: Steigung, Stufenmaße, Geländerhöhe, Knieleiste und Fußleiste. Ladebereiche brauchen Palettentor oder Schranke. Nachträgliches Ergänzen heißt meist Baustellenschweißen und Beschichtungsschäden.</p>\n<h2>Geschweißt oder geschraubt?</h2>\n<p>Träger, Stützenfüße und Anschlussbleche werden in der Werkstatt geschweißt und vor Ort verschraubt (siehe <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">geschweißt oder geschraubt</a>). Das reduziert Baustellenschweißen, schützt die Beschichtung und beschleunigt die Montage. Teile nach Lkw- und Tormaßen teilen.</p>\n<h2>Oberflächenschutz</h2>\n<p>In trockenen Innenräumen genügt meist Lack; feuchte Lager, Lebensmittelbereiche oder außen sprechen für Feuerverzinkung (siehe <a href=\"sicak-daldirma-galvaniz-kaynakli-parca.html\">Schweißteile für die Verzinkung</a>). Entlüftungs- und Ablauföffnungen gehören dann in die Werkstattzeichnung.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bei ArmaWeld:</strong> Wir schweißen Träger, Stützen, Treppen- und Geländerteile nach freigegebenen Werkstattzeichnungen. Zuschnitt, Bohren, Verzinken oder Lackieren und Montage koordinieren wir mit Partnern. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Stahlbau →</a></p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_faq":"<h2>Häufige Fragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Braucht eine Stahlbühne eine Statik?</h3><p>Ja; Nutzlasten, Spannweiten und Untergrund sind vom Tragwerksplaner zu berechnen.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Ist EN 1090 erforderlich?</h3><p>In Europa werden dauerhafte tragende Bauteile nach EN 1090-1 CE-gekennzeichnet, meist EXC2.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welche Norm für Treppen und Geländer?</h3><p>Die Reihe EN ISO 14122 für ortsfeste Zugänge.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wird vor Ort geschweißt?</h3><p>Meist werden Werkstattschweißteile vor Ort verschraubt.</p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_h3":"Eine Stahlbühne geplant?","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_p":"Senden Sie Statik und Werkstattzeichnungen; wir bieten die Fertigung an.","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_btn":"Angebot anfordern →","blog_related_h":"Verwandte Artikel","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Stahlkonstruktion: Von der Konstruktion zur Montage","blog_p02_exc2_h1":"Ausführungsklasse EXC2 nach EN 1090-2: Was ändert sich gegenüber EXC3?","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Geschweißt oder geschraubt? Ein technischer Leitfaden zur Wahl der Verbindung","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Schweißteile feuerverzinkungsgerecht konstruieren: Bohrungen, Schweißen und Stahlauswahl"},"es":{"blog_p97_mezzanine_title":"Fabricación de entreplantas y plataformas de acero: cálculo, EN 1090, barandillas y montaje | ArmaWeld","blog_p97_mezzanine_meta_desc":"Fabricación de entreplantas, plataformas de mantenimiento y de máquina: cálculo estructural y cargas, marcado CE según EN 1090, tramex o piso, escaleras y barandillas EN ISO 14122, galvanizado y montaje atornillado.","blog_p97_mezzanine_og_title":"Entreplantas y plataformas de acero","blog_p97_mezzanine_tag":"Guía de producto · Estructuras de acero","blog_p97_mezzanine_h1":"Fabricación de entreplantas y plataformas de acero: cálculo, EN 1090, barandillas y montaje","blog_p97_mezzanine_breadcrumb3":"Entreplantas","blog_p97_mezzanine_read":"7 min de lectura","blog_p97_mezzanine_body":"<p>Almacenaje extra, una pasarela de mantenimiento sobre una máquina o una oficina encima de la línea: las entreplantas son la forma más rápida de ganar superficie sin ampliar el edificio. Compras suele verlas como \"plataforma estándar\", pero son estructuras portantes y exigen rigor en cálculo, documentación y montaje.</p>\n<h2>Primero la carga, luego el perfil</h2>\n<p>El uso define la carga: tránsito peatonal, palets, estanterías, carretillas o transpaletas, peso de máquinas. Cargas, luces entre pilares y suelo (capacidad de la solera, anclajes) se evalúan juntas en el cálculo. El ingeniero define perfiles, uniones y soldaduras (ver <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">cálculo de soldaduras</a>). El taller trabaja con planos de fabricación basados en ese cálculo.</p>\n<h2>EN 1090 y marcado CE</h2>\n<p>En Europa los componentes de acero portantes instalados de forma permanente se comercializan con marcado CE según EN 1090-1; entreplantas y plataformas fijas suelen tratarse como EXC2 (ver <a href=\"en-1090-exc2-nedir.html\">qué es EN 1090 EXC2</a>).</p>\n<h2>Elección del piso</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tramex (rejilla):</strong> ligero, deja pasar luz y aire, compatible con rociadores; malla fina contra caída de piezas.</li>\n<li><strong>Chapa lagrimada:</strong> superficie cerrada; considere peso y deformación por soldadura.</li>\n<li><strong>Hormigón sobre chapa colaborante o tableros:</strong> habitual con estanterías pesadas y transpaletas.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Escaleras, barandillas y acceso</h2>\n<p>La serie EN ISO 14122 regula los medios de acceso permanentes a máquinas e instalaciones: pendiente, peldaños, altura de barandilla, listón intermedio y rodapié. Las zonas de carga necesitan puerta de palets o barrera. Añadirlo después suele significar soldadura en obra y daños en la pintura.</p>\n<h2>¿Soldado o atornillado?</h2>\n<p>Vigas, bases de pilar y placas se sueldan en taller y se atornillan en obra (ver <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">soldado o atornillado</a>). Reduce soldadura en obra, protege el recubrimiento y acelera el montaje. Divida las piezas según camión y puertas.</p>\n<h2>Protección superficial</h2>\n<p>En interiores secos basta la pintura; almacenes húmedos, zonas alimentarias o exterior piden galvanizado en caliente (ver <a href=\"sicak-daldirma-galvaniz-kaynakli-parca.html\">piezas para galvanizar</a>), con taladros de venteo y drenaje en plano.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>En ArmaWeld:</strong> soldamos vigas, pilares, escaleras y barandillas según planos aprobados. Corte, taladrado, galvanizado o pintura y montaje en obra se coordinan con socios. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Estructuras de acero →</a></p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_faq":"<h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Hace falta cálculo estructural?</h3><p>Sí; cargas de uso, luces y capacidad del suelo debe calcularlas un ingeniero.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Se requiere EN 1090?</h3><p>En Europa los componentes portantes permanentes llevan CE según EN 1090-1, normalmente EXC2.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Qué norma para escaleras y barandillas?</h3><p>La serie EN ISO 14122.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>¿Se suelda en obra?</h3><p>Normalmente las piezas soldadas en taller se atornillan en obra.</p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_h3":"¿Proyecta una entreplanta?","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_p":"Envíe cálculo y planos de fabricación; ofertaremos la fabricación.","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_btn":"Solicitar oferta →","blog_related_h":"Artículos relacionados","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Fabricación de Estructuras Metálicas: del Diseño al Montaje","blog_p02_exc2_h1":"¿Qué es la EXC2 de la EN 1090-2? Diferencias prácticas entre EXC2 y EXC3","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"¿Soldada o atornillada? Guía técnica para elegir la unión","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Cómo diseñar piezas soldadas para galvanizado en caliente: agujeros, soldadura y elección del acero"},"fr":{"blog_p97_mezzanine_title":"Fabrication de mezzanines et plateformes acier : calcul, EN 1090, garde-corps et montage | ArmaWeld","blog_p97_mezzanine_meta_desc":"Fabrication de mezzanines, plateformes de maintenance et de machines : calcul de structure et charges, marquage CE EN 1090, caillebotis ou plancher, escaliers et garde-corps EN ISO 14122, galvanisation et montage boulonné.","blog_p97_mezzanine_og_title":"Mezzanines et plateformes acier","blog_p97_mezzanine_tag":"Guide produit · Charpente métallique","blog_p97_mezzanine_h1":"Fabrication de mezzanines et plateformes acier : calcul, EN 1090, garde-corps et montage","blog_p97_mezzanine_breadcrumb3":"Mezzanines","blog_p97_mezzanine_read":"7 min de lecture","blog_p97_mezzanine_body":"<p>Stockage supplémentaire, passerelle de maintenance au-dessus d'une machine ou bureau au-dessus d'une ligne : la mezzanine est le moyen le plus rapide de gagner de la surface sans agrandir le bâtiment. Les achats la voient souvent comme une « plateforme standard », mais c'est une structure porteuse qui exige rigueur de calcul, de documentation et de montage.</p>\n<h2>D'abord la charge, ensuite le profilé</h2>\n<p>L'usage fixe la charge : circulation piétonne, palettes, rayonnages, chariots ou transpalettes, poids de machines. Charges, trame des poteaux et sol (capacité de la dalle, ancrages) sont évalués ensemble dans le calcul. L'ingénieur définit profilés, assemblages et soudures (voir <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">calcul des soudures</a>). Le fabricant travaille sur les plans d'atelier issus de ce calcul.</p>\n<h2>EN 1090 et marquage CE</h2>\n<p>En Europe, les composants porteurs installés durablement sont mis sur le marché avec marquage CE selon l'EN 1090-1 ; mezzanines et plateformes fixes relèvent généralement de l'EXC2 (voir <a href=\"en-1090-exc2-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC2</a>).</p>\n<h2>Choix du plancher</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Caillebotis :</strong> léger, laisse passer lumière et air, compatible sprinklers ; maille fine contre la chute de petites pièces.</li>\n<li><strong>Tôle larmée :</strong> surface fermée ; tenir compte du poids et des déformations.</li>\n<li><strong>Béton sur bac acier ou panneaux bois :</strong> courant pour rayonnages lourds et transpalettes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Escaliers, garde-corps et accès</h2>\n<p>La série EN ISO 14122 traite des moyens d'accès permanents aux machines : pente, marches, hauteur de garde-corps, lisse intermédiaire et plinthe. Les zones de chargement demandent un portillon palette ou une barrière. Les ajouter après coup signifie souvent soudure sur site et revêtement abîmé.</p>\n<h2>Soudé ou boulonné ?</h2>\n<p>Poutres, pieds de poteaux et platines sont soudés en atelier et boulonnés sur site (voir <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">soudé ou boulonné</a>). On limite la soudure sur site, protège le revêtement et accélère le montage. Découpez selon camion et portes.</p>\n<h2>Protection de surface</h2>\n<p>En intérieur sec, la peinture suffit ; entrepôts humides, zones alimentaires ou extérieur appellent la galvanisation à chaud (voir <a href=\"sicak-daldirma-galvaniz-kaynakli-parca.html\">pièces pour galvanisation</a>), avec évents et purges sur plan.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Chez ArmaWeld :</strong> nous soudons poutres, poteaux, escaliers et garde-corps selon des plans validés. Découpe, perçage, galvanisation ou peinture et montage sur site sont coordonnés avec nos partenaires. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Construction métallique →</a></p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_faq":"<h2>Questions fréquentes</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Une mezzanine demande-t-elle un calcul ?</h3><p>Oui ; charges, portées et capacité du sol sont calculées par un ingénieur.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>L'EN 1090 est-elle requise ?</h3><p>En Europe, les composants porteurs permanents sont marqués CE selon l'EN 1090-1, souvent EXC2.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quelle norme pour escaliers et garde-corps ?</h3><p>La série EN ISO 14122.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Le montage est-il soudé ?</h3><p>Généralement, les pièces soudées en atelier sont boulonnées sur site.</p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_h3":"Un projet de mezzanine ?","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_p":"Envoyez calcul et plans d'atelier ; nous chiffrerons la fabrication.","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_btn":"Demander un devis →","blog_related_h":"Articles associés","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Fabrication de Charpentes Métalliques : du Calcul au Montage","blog_p02_exc2_h1":"Classe d’exécution EXC2 selon l’EN 1090-2 : ce qui change par rapport à l’EXC3","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Soudé ou boulonné ? Guide technique pour choisir l’assemblage","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Concevoir une pièce soudée pour la galvanisation à chaud : trous, soudage et choix de l'acier"},"it":{"blog_p97_mezzanine_title":"Produzione di soppalchi e piattaforme in acciaio: calcolo, EN 1090, parapetti e montaggio | ArmaWeld","blog_p97_mezzanine_meta_desc":"Produzione di soppalchi, piattaforme di manutenzione e per macchine: calcolo strutturale e carichi, marcatura CE EN 1090, grigliato o piano, scale e parapetti EN ISO 14122, zincatura e montaggio bullonato.","blog_p97_mezzanine_og_title":"Soppalchi e piattaforme in acciaio","blog_p97_mezzanine_tag":"Guida prodotto · Carpenteria metallica","blog_p97_mezzanine_h1":"Produzione di soppalchi e piattaforme in acciaio: calcolo, EN 1090, parapetti e montaggio","blog_p97_mezzanine_breadcrumb3":"Soppalchi","blog_p97_mezzanine_read":"7 min di lettura","blog_p97_mezzanine_body":"<p>Spazio di stoccaggio extra, passerella di manutenzione sopra una macchina o ufficio sopra la linea: il soppalco è il modo più rapido per guadagnare superficie senza ampliare l'edificio. Gli acquisti lo vedono spesso come \"piattaforma standard\", ma è una struttura portante e richiede rigore di calcolo, documentazione e montaggio.</p>\n<h2>Prima il carico, poi il profilo</h2>\n<p>L'uso definisce il carico: pedonale, pallet, scaffalature, carrelli o transpallet, peso delle macchine. Carichi, maglia dei pilastri e pavimento (portata della platea, ancoraggi) si valutano insieme nel calcolo. L'ingegnere definisce profili, giunti e saldature (vedi <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">calcolo delle saldature</a>). Chi produce lavora sui disegni costruttivi derivati.</p>\n<h2>EN 1090 e marcatura CE</h2>\n<p>In Europa i componenti portanti installati in modo permanente sono immessi sul mercato con marcatura CE secondo EN 1090-1; soppalchi e piattaforme fisse sono di norma in EXC2 (vedi <a href=\"en-1090-exc2-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC2</a>).</p>\n<h2>Scelta del piano</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Grigliato:</strong> leggero, lascia passare luce e aria, compatibile con sprinkler; maglia fitta contro la caduta di minuteria.</li>\n<li><strong>Lamiera mandorlata:</strong> superficie chiusa; considerare peso e deformazioni.</li>\n<li><strong>Getto su lamiera grecata o pannelli in legno:</strong> comune con scaffalature pesanti e transpallet.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Scale, parapetti e accessi</h2>\n<p>La serie EN ISO 14122 riguarda i mezzi di accesso permanenti alle macchine: pendenza, gradini, altezza del parapetto, corrente intermedio e fermapiede. Le zone di carico richiedono cancelli per pallet o barriere. Aggiungerli dopo significa spesso saldature in cantiere e danni al rivestimento.</p>\n<h2>Saldato o bullonato?</h2>\n<p>Travi, piastre di base e piastre di giunzione si saldano in officina e si bullonano in cantiere (vedi <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">saldato o bullonato</a>). Meno saldature in cantiere, rivestimento protetto, montaggio più rapido. Suddividere le parti secondo camion e porte.</p>\n<h2>Protezione superficiale</h2>\n<p>In interni asciutti basta la verniciatura; magazzini umidi, aree alimentari o esterni richiedono la zincatura a caldo (vedi <a href=\"sicak-daldirma-galvaniz-kaynakli-parca.html\">pezzi per zincatura</a>), con fori di sfiato e scarico a disegno.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>In ArmaWeld:</strong> saldiamo travi, pilastri, scale e parapetti su disegni approvati. Taglio, foratura, zincatura o verniciatura e montaggio in cantiere sono coordinati con i partner. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Carpenteria metallica →</a></p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_faq":"<h2>Domande frequenti</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Serve un calcolo strutturale?</h3><p>Sì; carichi, luci e portata del pavimento vanno calcolati da un ingegnere.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Serve la EN 1090?</h3><p>In Europa i componenti portanti permanenti hanno CE secondo EN 1090-1, di solito EXC2.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Quale norma per scale e parapetti?</h3><p>La serie EN ISO 14122.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Il montaggio è saldato?</h3><p>Di norma i pezzi saldati in officina si bullonano in cantiere.</p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_h3":"Progettate un soppalco?","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_p":"Inviate calcolo e disegni costruttivi; quoteremo la produzione.","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_btn":"Richiedi offerta →","blog_related_h":"Articoli correlati","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Carpenteria metallica: dalla progettazione al montaggio","blog_p02_exc2_h1":"Classe di esecuzione EXC2 secondo la EN 1090-2: cosa cambia rispetto alla EXC3","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Saldato o bullonato? Guida tecnica alla scelta del collegamento","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Come progettare pezzi saldati per la zincatura a caldo: fori, saldatura e scelta dell'acciaio"},"nl":{"blog_p97_mezzanine_title":"Entresols en stalen bordessen produceren: berekening, EN 1090, leuningen en montage | ArmaWeld","blog_p97_mezzanine_meta_desc":"Productie van entresols, onderhouds- en machinebordessen: constructieberekening en belastingen, CE-markering EN 1090, roosters of vloerplaten, trappen en leuningen volgens EN ISO 14122, verzinken en geboute montage.","blog_p97_mezzanine_og_title":"Entresols en stalen bordessen","blog_p97_mezzanine_tag":"Productgids · Staalbouw","blog_p97_mezzanine_h1":"Entresols en stalen bordessen produceren: berekening, EN 1090, leuningen en montage","blog_p97_mezzanine_breadcrumb3":"Entresols","blog_p97_mezzanine_read":"7 min lezen","blog_p97_mezzanine_body":"<p>Extra opslag, een onderhoudsloopbrug boven een machine of een kantoor boven de lijn: een entresol is de snelste manier om ruimte te winnen zonder uit te bouwen. Inkoop ziet het vaak als \"standaardbordes\", maar het is een dragende constructie die discipline vraagt in berekening, documentatie en montage.</p>\n<h2>Eerst de belasting, dan het profiel</h2>\n<p>Het gebruik bepaalt de belasting: looppad, pallets, stellingen, heftruck of palletwagen, machinegewicht. Belasting, kolomstramien en ondergrond (draagvermogen van de vloer, verankering) worden samen in de berekening beoordeeld. De constructeur legt profielen, verbindingen en lassen vast (zie <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">lasberekening</a>). De producent werkt met de daarop gebaseerde werktekeningen.</p>\n<h2>EN 1090 en CE-markering</h2>\n<p>In Europa worden permanent ingebouwde dragende staalcomponenten met CE-markering volgens EN 1090-1 op de markt gebracht; entresols en vaste bordessen meestal in EXC2 (zie <a href=\"en-1090-exc2-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC2</a>).</p>\n<h2>Vloerkeuze</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Roosters:</strong> licht, laten licht en lucht door, sprinklervriendelijk; fijne maas tegen vallende kleine delen.</li>\n<li><strong>Traanplaat:</strong> gesloten oppervlak; let op gewicht en lasvervorming.</li>\n<li><strong>Beton op staalplaat of houten platen:</strong> gangbaar bij zware stellingen en palletwagens.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Trappen, leuningen en toegang</h2>\n<p>De reeks EN ISO 14122 behandelt vaste toegangsmiddelen tot machines: helling, treden, leuninghoogte, knieregel en schoprand. Laadzones vragen een palletpoort of slagboom. Achteraf toevoegen betekent meestal lassen op locatie en coatingschade.</p>\n<h2>Gelast of gebout?</h2>\n<p>Liggers, kolomvoeten en kopplaten worden in de werkplaats gelast en op locatie gebout (zie <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">gelast of gebout</a>). Minder lassen op locatie, coating beschermd, snellere montage. Deel onderdelen op naar vrachtwagen- en deurmaten.</p>\n<h2>Oppervlaktebescherming</h2>\n<p>Binnen en droog volstaat lak; vochtige magazijnen, voedingszones of buiten vragen thermisch verzinken (zie <a href=\"sicak-daldirma-galvaniz-kaynakli-parca.html\">onderdelen voor verzinken</a>), met ont- en beluchtingsgaten op tekening.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Bij ArmaWeld:</strong> we lassen liggers, kolommen, trappen en leuningen volgens goedgekeurde werktekeningen. Snijden, boren, verzinken of lakken en montage coördineren we met partners. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Staalconstructie →</a></p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_faq":"<h2>Veelgestelde vragen</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Is een berekening nodig?</h3><p>Ja; belasting, overspanningen en vloercapaciteit berekent een constructeur.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Is EN 1090 vereist?</h3><p>In Europa krijgen permanente dragende componenten CE volgens EN 1090-1, meestal EXC2.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Welke norm voor trappen en leuningen?</h3><p>De reeks EN ISO 14122.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Wordt op locatie gelast?</h3><p>Meestal worden werkplaatsgelaste delen op locatie gebout.</p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_h3":"Een entresol gepland?","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_p":"Stuur berekening en werktekeningen; we offreren de productie.","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_btn":"Offerte aanvragen →","blog_related_h":"Gerelateerde artikelen","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Staalbouw: van ontwerp tot montage","blog_p02_exc2_h1":"Uitvoeringsklasse EXC2 volgens EN 1090-2: wat verandert er ten opzichte van EXC3?","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Gelast of gebout? Een technische gids voor de keuze van de verbinding","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Gelaste onderdelen ontwerpen voor thermisch verzinken: gaten, lassen en staalkeuze"},"no":{"blog_p97_mezzanine_title":"Produksjon av mesaniner og stålplattformer: beregning, EN 1090, rekkverk og montasje | ArmaWeld","blog_p97_mezzanine_meta_desc":"Produksjon av mesaniner, vedlikeholds- og maskinplattformer: konstruksjonsberegning og laster, CE-merking etter EN 1090, rist eller dekke, trapper og rekkverk etter EN ISO 14122, forsinking og boltet montasje.","blog_p97_mezzanine_og_title":"Mesaniner og stålplattformer","blog_p97_mezzanine_tag":"Produktguide · Stålkonstruksjon","blog_p97_mezzanine_h1":"Produksjon av mesaniner og stålplattformer: beregning, EN 1090, rekkverk og montasje","blog_p97_mezzanine_breadcrumb3":"Mesaniner","blog_p97_mezzanine_read":"7 min lesing","blog_p97_mezzanine_body":"<p>Ekstra lager, en vedlikeholdsgangbro over en maskin eller et kontor over linjen: en mesanin er den raskeste måten å få mer areal uten å bygge ut. Innkjøp ser den ofte som en \"standardplattform\", men det er en bærende konstruksjon som krever disiplin i beregning, dokumentasjon og montasje.</p>\n<h2>Først lasten, så profilet</h2>\n<p>Bruken bestemmer lasten: gangtrafikk, paller, reoler, truck eller jekketralle, maskinvekt. Laster, søyleavstand og underlag (gulvets bæreevne, forankring) vurderes samlet i beregningen. Konstruktøren fastsetter profiler, forbindelser og sveiser (se <a href=\"kaynak-dikisi-mukavemet-hesabi.html\">sveiseberegning</a>). Produsenten arbeider etter verkstedtegninger basert på beregningen.</p>\n<h2>EN 1090 og CE-merking</h2>\n<p>I Europa omsettes permanent innebygde bærende stålkomponenter med CE-merking etter EN 1090-1; mesaniner og faste plattformer behandles normalt som EXC2 (se <a href=\"en-1090-exc2-nedir.html\">EN 1090 EXC2</a>).</p>\n<h2>Valg av dekke</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Gitterrist:</strong> lett, slipper gjennom lys og luft, sprinklervennlig; finmasket mot fallende smådeler.</li>\n<li><strong>Tårnplate (riflet plate):</strong> lukket flate; ta hensyn til vekt og sveisedeformasjon.</li>\n<li><strong>Betong på profilplate eller trebaserte plater:</strong> vanlig ved tunge reoler og jekketraller.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Trapper, rekkverk og adkomst</h2>\n<p>Serien EN ISO 14122 omfatter permanente adkomstmidler til maskiner: stigning, trinn, rekkverkshøyde, knelist og fotlist. Lasteområder trenger palleport eller bom. Å legge til senere betyr ofte sveising på stedet og skadet belegg.</p>\n<h2>Sveiset eller boltet?</h2>\n<p>Bjelker, søylefot og knutepunktplater sveises på verksted og boltes på stedet (se <a href=\"kaynakli-mi-civatali-mi-birlestirme.html\">sveiset eller boltet</a>). Mindre sveising på stedet, beskyttet belegg og raskere montasje. Del opp etter bil- og portmål.</p>\n<h2>Overflatebeskyttelse</h2>\n<p>Innendørs og tørt holder maling; fuktige lagre, næringsmiddelområder eller utendørs krever varmforsinking (se <a href=\"sicak-daldirma-galvaniz-kaynakli-parca.html\">deler for forsinking</a>), med lufte- og dreneringshull på tegning.</p>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Hos ArmaWeld:</strong> vi sveiser bjelker, søyler, trapper og rekkverk etter godkjente verkstedtegninger. Kutting, boring, forsinking eller maling og montasje koordineres med partnere. <a href=\"../celik-konstruksiyon.html\">Stålkonstruksjon →</a></p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_faq":"<h2>Ofte stilte spørsmål</h2><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Trengs beregning?</h3><p>Ja; laster, spenn og gulvkapasitet beregnes av en konstruktør.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Kreves EN 1090?</h3><p>I Europa CE-merkes permanente bærende komponenter etter EN 1090-1, vanligvis EXC2.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Hvilken standard for trapper og rekkverk?</h3><p>Serien EN ISO 14122.</p></div><div class=\"faq-item\"><h3>Sveises det på stedet?</h3><p>Vanligvis boltes verkstedsveisede deler sammen på stedet.</p></div>","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_h3":"Planlegger du en mesanin?","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_p":"Send beregning og verkstedtegninger; vi gir tilbud på produksjon.","blog_p97_mezzanine_cta_btn":"Be om tilbud →","blog_related_h":"Relaterte artikler","blog_celik_konstruksiyon_imalat_h1":"Stålkonstruksjonsproduksjon: Fra design til montasje","blog_p02_exc2_h1":"Utførelsesklasse EXC2 etter EN 1090-2: hva endres sammenlignet med EXC3?","blog_p19_boltweld_h1":"Sveiset eller boltet? En teknisk veiledning for valg av forbindelse","blog_n29_galv_h1":"Slik konstruerer du sveiste deler for varmforsinking: hull, sveising og valg av stål"}};for(var l in d){var t=T[l]||(T[l]={});for(var k in d[l])t[k]=d[l][k];}})();
